    "visible_chars": 253,
    "text": "可以用循环实现：def binary_search(arr, target): left, right = 0, len(arr) - 1; while left <= right: mid = (left + right) // 2; if arr[mid] == target: return mid; elif arr[mid] < target: left = mid + 1; else: right = mid - 1; return -1。时间复杂度 O(log n)，空间复杂度 O(1)。",
